---

The optional "revise while typing" feature downloads and runs DistilGPT-2,
released by Hugging Face under the Apache 2.0 License. The model weights are
fetched from Hugging Face the first time you use the feature (or bundled into
the packaged app) and cached locally; they are not distributed as part of this
source repository.
